WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,170
what

2
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:13,630
Brother Tingtingting said, don’t cry yet. Brother, I believe your brother will be here soon. What happened to my sister?

3
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:21,410
Someone said she stole something and called the police. I have to go to school to send you home first. What else can I give you as a gift?

4
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:25,640
I'll go with you. Let's go to school first.

5
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,260
I heard that Chen Tingting, who was in the senior year of high school

6
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,300
Is it true that I stole the teacher’s gold necklace?

7
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,860
Haven't her grades always been pretty good?

8
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,060
who knows

9
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,060
I heard that necklace costs more than 8,000 yuan

10
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,310
Not learning well at a young age

11
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:41,830
Stealing things and refusing to admit it

12
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:46,420
I have to call the police today. I don’t have it. So where did my necklace go?

13
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:54,580
Could it be that my long legs ran away? Brother Tingting is here. What happened?

14
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:57,930
You are her brother and you came just in time.

15
00:00:58,370 --> 00:00:59,330
sister steals things

16
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:00,530
You are still so sensible and strong

17
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,500
no matter what happened

18
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:05,300
You have the nerve to ask

19
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:07,460
a gold necklace in my drawer

20
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:10,100
More than 20 pills and more than 8,000 are missing.

21
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:12,680
The surveillance can clearly see that period of time

22
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:15,160
She was the only one who had ever entered the office. Who else could it be?

23
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:17,280
I really didn't say anything back.

24
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,000
The surveillance video captured her taking the necklace.

25
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,620
She's been in and out of the office

26
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:22,900
She is the only one on the surveillance camera. What I am asking is

27
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:25,980
Have you ever photographed her holding the necklace? Does this still need to be photographed?

28
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,180
No one in the office

29
00:01:27,180 --> 00:01:28,220
She was the only one who went in

30
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,100
what does the office do

31
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:33,210
Teacher Su asked me to come to the office

32
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:34,290
Get our class's homework

33
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:35,370
I took it and left

34
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:40,150
Nothing else works

35
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:45,350
Don't act like brother and sister here. Are you done?
